        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mbindo ya nzoto ya mibali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe alobaki na Moyize mpe Aron :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "« Boloba na bana ya Isalaele mpe boyebisa bango : ‹ Soki nzoto ya mibali ya mobali moko ezali kobimisa tofina to mayi, kobima yango ekomisi mobali yango mbindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ata soki tofina to mayi ekobi kobima na nzoto na ye to ekangami, azali kaka mbindo. Tala ndenge kobima ya tofina to ya mayi yango ekomisaka moto mbindo :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbeto nyonso oyo mobali oyo azali kobimisa tofina to mayi na nzoto na ye ya mibali akolala to eloko nyonso oyo akovandela ekokoma mbindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moto nyonso oyo akosimba mbeto na ye asengeli kosukola bilamba na ye mpe nzoto na ye na mayi, mpe akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moto oyo akovanda likolo ya eloko oyo mobali oyo azali kobima tofina to mayi na nzoto na ye ya mibali avandelaki, asengeli kosukola bilamba na ye mpe nzoto na ye na mayi, mpe akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moto oyo akosimba mobali oyo azali kobima tofina to mayi na nzoto na ye ya mibali, asengeli kosukola bilamba na ye mpe nzoto na ye na mayi, mpe akozala mbindo kino pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soki mobali oyo azali kobima tofina to mayi na nzoto na ye ya mibali abwakeli moto oyo azali peto soyi, moto yango asengeli kosukola bilamba na ye mpe nzoto na ye na mayi, mpe akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eloko nyonso oyo mobali oyo azali kobima tofina to mayi na nzoto na ye ya mibali akovandela likolo ya mpunda tango azali kosala mobembo, ekokoma mbindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moto nyonso oyo akosimba eloko nyonso kati na biloko oyo ezali na se ya mobali yango, akozala mbindo kino na pokwa ; mpe moto nyonso oyo akolokota biloko yango asengeli kosukola bilamba na ye mpe nzoto na ye na mayi, mpe akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moto nyonso oyo mobali oyo azali kobima tofina to mayi na nzoto na ye ya mibali akosimba na kozanga komisukola maboko na mayi, asengeli kosukola bilamba na ye mpe nzoto na ye na mayi, mpe akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbeki nyonso oyo esalema na mabele oyo bakosimba na mobali oyo azali kobima tofina to mayi, basengeli kopanza yango ; mpe eloko nyonso oyo esalema na nzete basengeli kosukola yango na mayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soki tofina to mayi etiki kobima na nzoto ya mibali ya mobali yango, akotanga mikolo sambo mpo na kopetolama na ye ; sima akosukola bilamba na ye, akosukola nzoto na ye na mayi ya etima mpe akokoma peto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mokolo ya mwambe, akozwa bibenga mibale ya zamba to bana bibenga mibale mpe akoya liboso ya Yawe na ekuke ya Ndako ya kapo ya Bokutani. Akopesa yango epai ya Nganga-Nzambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nganga-Nzambe akobonza yango, moko lokola mbeka ya masumu mpe mosusu lokola mbeka ya kotumba. Na nzela wana nde Nganga-Nzambe akosala mosala ya bolimbisi masumu mpo na mobali yango liboso ya Yawe likolo ya kobima tofina to mayi na nzoto na ye ya mibali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soki mobali abimi mayi ya mibali na nzoto na ye ya mibali, asengeli kosukola nzoto na ye mobimba na mayi mpe akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elamba nyonso to eloko nyonso oyo esalema na poso ya nyama oyo ekweyeli mayi ya mibali, esengeli basukola yango na mayi, mpe ekozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soki mobali asangisi nzoto na mwasi, bango mibale basengeli kosukola nzoto na mayi mpe bakozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mbindo ya nzoto ya basi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soki mwasi amoni makila na ye ya sanza, akozala mbindo mikolo sambo, mpe moto nyonso oyo akosimba ye akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eloko nyonso oyo akolalela na tango wana ekokoma mbindo, mpe eloko nyonso oyo akovandela ekokoma mbindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moto nyonso oyo akosimba mbeto na ye akosukola bilamba na ye mpe nzoto na ye na mayi mpe akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moto nyonso oyo akosimba eloko oyo mwasi yango avandeli, asengeli kosukola bilamba na ye mpe nzoto na ye na mayi, mpe akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soki eloko ezali na mbeto na ye to likolo ya eloko oyo avandeli, moto oyo akosimba yango akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soki mobali moko asangisi na ye nzoto mpe makila na ye ya sanza ezwi mobali yango, akozala mbindo mikolo sambo. Bongo mbeto nyonso oyo mobali yango akolalela, ekokoma mbindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soki mwasi azali kobima makila mikolo ebele na tango oyo amonaka makila na ye ya sanza te to azali kokoba kobima makila penza na tango oyo amonaka makila na ye ya sanza, akozala mbindo mikolo nyonso oyo azali kobima makila lokola na mikolo oyo amonaka makila na ye ya sanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbeto nyonso oyo akolalela na tango oyo makila na ye ezali kokoba kobima, ekozala mbindo ; mpe eloko nyonso oyo akovandela ekokoma mbindo lokola na tango oyo amonaka makila na ye ya sanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moto nyonso oyo akosimba biloko wana akokoma mbindo. Asengeli kosukola bilamba mpe nzoto na ye na mayi ; akozala mbindo kino na pokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soki apetolami na kobima makila na ye, asengeli kotanga mikolo sambo ; sima na yango, akokoma peto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mokolo ya mwambe, akozwa bibenga mibale ya zamba to bana bibenga mibale mpe akomema yango epai ya Nganga-Nzambe na ekuke ya Ndako ya kapo ya Bokutani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nganga-Nzambe akobonza yango, moko lokola mbeka ya masumu mpe mosusu lokola mbeka ya kotumba. Na nzela wana nde Nganga-Nzambe akosala mosala ya bolimbisi masumu mpo na mwasi yango liboso ya Yawe mpo na mbindo ya kobima makila na ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
